course: dictionary
lesson: 14081
title: One short word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are short forms of longer words, and one short word can stand for several different things. The context, meaning the words around it, tells you which one is meant. Look at the clues first.
explain: «Mum said, "Take your meds with a glass of water."» Meds is short for medicine, so it means the medicine a doctor or nurse has given you. «Ben wants to go to med school to become a doctor.» Here med is short for medical, so it is about learning to be a doctor.
explain: «We are flying to the Med for our summer holiday.» The word holiday and the idea of flying to a place by the sea are the clues. Here the Med means the Mediterranean Sea and the countries around it. Always check your meaning by putting it back into the sentence.
fact: Med is an informal, short word, so you will meet it mostly in speech and chat.
fact: «Meds» means medicine or medication, and it is usually plural, meaning more than one.
fact: «Med» can be short for medical, as in «med school» (medical school).
fact: «The Med» means the Mediterranean Sea and the countries around it.
fact: Only take medicine that a trusted adult gives you.
exercise: «Did you take your meds this morning?» What does meds mean? | Medium-sized clothes | Mediterranean countries | *Medicine | Medical school
exercise: «Ben is a med student who wants to be a doctor.» What does med mean here? | Mediterranean | Meat | Medium | *Medical
exercise: «We flew to the Med for our holiday.» What is the Med? | *The Mediterranean Sea and the countries around it | A kind of school | A shop in town | A type of medicine
test: On a menu, a label says «med» next to a shirt size. What does med mean here? | Medicine | Medical | Mediterranean | *Medium
test: A friend offers you a pill from her bag. What should you do? | Share it with your brother | Take half and keep the rest | Take it straight away to feel better | *Say no and ask a trusted adult before you take any meds
exam: Which meaning of med fits «Sam wants to go to med school to become a doctor»? | *Medical | Mediterranean | Meds | Medium
